#. +> trunk6
#: kilestdactions.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "The \\vspace command adds vertical space. The length of the space can be expressed in any terms that LaTeX understands, i.e., points, inches, etc. You can add negative as well as positive space with an \\vspace command."
msgstr "A orde \\vspace engade un espazo vertical. O tamaño do espazo pódese expresar de calquera xeito que LaTeX entenda, p. ex. en puntos, polgadas, etc. Coa orde \\vspace pode usar tanto valores negativos como positivos."

